sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Player
  participant P as Player.tsx
  participant S as puzzleStore and gameStore
  participant X as useSceneFx and useGameAudio
  participant H as Howler
  participant E as EndingSequence
  U->>P: press E on key trigger after tape 5
  P->>S: collectKey sets hasFrontDoorKey true
  S-->>X: subscription fires on hasFrontDoorKey
  X->>H: fade out Margaret theme
  X->>H: start heartbeat loop and ramp volume and rate over 45s
  X->>X: suppress 60s scream stingers
  U->>P: walk to front door and press E
  P->>S: triggerEnding clears modals and sets endingActive
  S-->>E: render jumpscare overlay
  E->>H: play scream stinger
  E->>E: after 2.4s play outro MP4 with HTML subtitles
  E->>E: credits roll
  E->>S: goToLanding sets started false and wipes puzzleStore
  S-->>U: back on the start screen with tapes and puzzles wiped
